  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indo-Pacific Net-Zero Transition Bond - research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment covers costs for completed independent research on the use of proceeds strategy and for Australian investor engagement strategies for an Indo-Pacific Net-Zero Transition Bond series. This was previously a joint initiative with the US (through USAID and US DFC). DFAT is continuing to advance this Net-Zero Bond initiative.</narrative>
